      <details class="etf-section">
    <summary class="etf-section-title">相关ETF（十大持仓中含本板块核心个股 ≥ 3 只，且当日成交额 > 0.5亿，共 5 只，点击展开）</summary>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="etf-table" id="etf-table-pt01850531-">
      <colgroup><col style="width:24%"><col style="width:11%"><col style="width:11%"><col style="width:12%"><col style="width:12%"><col style="width:12%"><col style="width:18%"></colgroup>
      <thead><tr>
